# ORCA Texture Assets
#
# Earth textures and environment maps:
#
#   earth-day.jpg         — day map (albedo), sRGB
#   earth-bump.jpg        — bump/displacement map
#   earth-specular.jpg    — specular / roughness map (oceans shine)
#   earth-clouds.png      — cloud layer with alpha, PNG
#   earth-night.jpg       — night lights (emissive)
#   stars.jpg             — starfield / environment background
#
# Recommended specs:
#   - Equirectangular projection (2:1)
#   - Max resolution: 8192x4096 for hero, 4096x2048 for standard
#   - sRGB color space for albedo / emissive maps
#   - Linear color space for bump / specular / roughness
#   - KTX2 or WebP for delivery where possible